          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " robots.",
          "start": 1641.26,
          "end": 1641.76,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And it's not up to Satan to decide that.",
