          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " witnessed",
          "start": 5533.92,
          "end": 5533.92,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "That's why we can say, Ash-hadu Alla Elaha Ella Allah.",
      "start": 5533.92,
      "end": 5533.92,
      "speaker": "Parivash",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " God.",
          "start": 5533.92,
          "end": 5533.92,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " That's",
          "start": 5533.92,
          "end": 5533.92,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " why",
          "start": 5533.92,
          "end": 5533.92,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " we",
          "start": 5533.92,
          "end": 5533.92,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " can",
          "start": 5533.92,
          "end": 5533.92,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " say,",
          "start": 5533.92,
          "end": 5533.92,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " Ash-hadu",
          "start": 5533.92,
          "end": 5533.92,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " Alla",
          "start": 5533.92,
          "end": 5533.92,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " Elaha",
          "start": 5533.92,
          "end": 5533.92,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " Ella",
          "start": 5533.92,
          "end": 5533.92,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But have you ever seen Muhammad with your eyes? Dr. Khalifa: Did you see Muhammad? M\u00e3 Sh\u00e3 All\u00e3h.",
      "start": 5533.92,
      "end": 5533.92,
      "speaker": "Parivash",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Allah.",
          "start": 5533.92,
          "end": 5533.92,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " But",
          "start": 5533.92,
          "end": 5533.92,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " have",
          "start": 5533.92,
          "end": 5533.92,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " you",
