          "speaker": "Mahmood Abib"
        },
        {
          "word": " Stephen",
          "start": 5533.92,
          "end": 5533.92,
          "speaker": "Mahmood Abib"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, Hawking. Do you know (unintelligible) yesterday?",
